    <div id="mainContent">
            <p class="Division"><a name="13.14.001"></a>Division 13-14-001<br />Pedestrian and Bicycle Facilities</p>


            <p class="digCH">Sections:</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff13/Flagstaff1314001.html#13.14.001.0001">13-14-001-0001</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Design Standards</p>

      <h3 class="Cite" id="13.14.001.0001"><a name="13.14.001.0001">13-14-001-0001</a> Design Standards</h3>
            <p class="P0">Bicycle facilities shall be designed in accordance with the most current AASHTO &quot;Guide for the Development of Bicycle Facilities.&quot; (Ord. 2017-22, Rep&amp;ReEn, 07/05/2017; Ord. 2024-13, Amended, 4/16/2024 (Res. 2024-15))</p>

